{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19139","headline":"白舍人自杭州寄新诗有柳色春藏苏小家之句因而戏酬兼寄浙东元相公 · 刘禹锡","name":"白舍人自杭州寄新诗有柳色春藏苏小家之句因而戏酬兼寄浙东元相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"钱塘山水有奇声，暂谪仙官领百城。\n女妓还闻名小小，使君谁许唤卿卿。\n鳌惊震海风雷起，蜃鬬嘘天楼阁成。\n莫道骚人在三楚，文星今向斗牛明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19139.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19139","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}